{"route":"/docs/5.0/utilities/shadows/","version":"5.0","renderedVersion":"5.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Shadows","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add or remove shadows to elements with box-shadow utilities."},"blocks":[{"id":"examples","type":"heading","en":"Examples","level":2},{"id":"examples--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"While shadows on components are disabled by default in Bootstrap and can be enabled via <code>$enable-shadows</code>, you can also quickly add or remove a shadow with our <code>box-shadow</code> utility classes. Includes support for <code>.shadow-none</code> and three default sizes (which have associated variables to match)."},{"id":"examples--example-1","type":"demo","key":"e1d793a886f9ac16b505","height":228},{"id":"examples--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"shadow-none p-3 mb-5 bg-light rounded\">No shadow</div>\n<div class=\"shadow-sm p-3 mb-5 bg-body rounded\">Small shadow</div>\n<div class=\"shadow p-3 mb-5 bg-body rounded\">Regular shadow</div>\n<div class=\"shadow-lg p-3 mb-5 bg-body rounded\">Larger shadow</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"sass","type":"heading","en":"Sass","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"$box-shadow:                  0 .5rem 1rem rgba($black, .15);\n$box-shadow-sm:               0 .125rem .25rem rgba($black, .075);\n$box-shadow-lg:               0 1rem 3rem rgba($black, .175);\n$box-shadow-inset:            inset 0 1px 2px rgba($black, .075);","language":"scss"},{"id":"utilities-api","type":"heading","en":"Utilities API","level":3},{"id":"utilities-api--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Shadow utilities are declared in our utilities API in <code>scss/_utilities.scss</code>. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/utilities/api/#using-the-api\">Learn how to use the utilities API.</a>"},{"id":"utilities-api--code-1","type":"code","value":"    \"shadow\": (\n      property: box-shadow,\n      class: shadow,\n      values: (\n        null: $box-shadow,\n        sm: $box-shadow-sm,\n        lg: $box-shadow-lg,\n        none: none,\n      )\n    ),","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"e1d793a886f9ac16b505","html":"\n<div class=\"shadow-none p-3 mb-5 bg-light rounded\">No shadow</div>\n<div class=\"shadow-sm p-3 mb-5 bg-body rounded\">Small shadow</div>\n<div class=\"shadow p-3 mb-5 bg-body rounded\">Regular shadow</div>\n<div class=\"shadow-lg p-3 mb-5 bg-body rounded\">Larger shadow</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Build tools","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/build-tools/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/parcel/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"RFS","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/rfs/"},{"en":"RTL","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/rtl/"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/customize/overview/"},{"en":"Sass","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/customize/sass/"},{"en":"Options","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/customize/options/"},{"en":"Color","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/customize/color/"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/customize/components/"},{"en":"CSS variables","